  "title": "Nostalgic Bed",
  "description": "Replaces the modern Bed crafting system with the oldschool nostalgic Red Bed Recipe.",
  "body": "![Image Displaying Logo of Nostalgic Bed Datapack](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e3746bd9c2bf03fbba9a3cc89b38dbe6e34bc12b.png)\n<center>\n  <a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://discord.gg/R2G6EMW42H\">\n    <img title=\"Join my Discord!\" alt=\"Join my Discord!\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1246931472615735426?logo=discord&label=Join%20the%20Discord&labelColor=eeeeee&color=%09%237289da&\">\n  </a>\n  <a target=\"blank\" title=\"Download on Modrinth!\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/nostalgic-bed/versions\">\n    <img alt=\"Download on Modrinth!\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/73IDb6tB?style=flat&logo=modrinth&label=Download&labelColor=eeeeee&color=2ead64\">\n  </a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\nThis is a nostalgia Datapack/Mod. You can craft the Red Bed with any wool/wood combination. To get other colors, just dye the Bed. It also makes crafting the Bed on your first day much less of a hassle.\n\n![An Image showing an example Crafting process](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/73IDb6tB/images/0d51d9fe702ddf9254fa8d09f36e253bec5e2e42.png)\n\n## 🛠️ Installation\n\n### Datapack Installation Guide\nCopy the .zip archive into the \".minecraft/saves/__yourworldname__/datapacks\" folder, where __yourworldname__ is the name of your world.\n\n### Mod installation Guide\nCopy the .jar archive into the folder your Mod Loader of choice provides.\n\n## ❗Issues & Suggestions\nPlease report issues immediately on [my Discord](https://discord.gg/R2G6EMW42H).",
